Gothic 3 — a continuation of the legendary role-playing series, this time the action moves from the island to the mainland. The orcs have defeated the humans and conquered their kingdom, but they refuse to give up. Rebel groups are hiding in the forests of Myrtana, gathering strength and awaiting the right opportunity to reclaim their lands. Players will download Gothic 3 via torrent in Russian here, assume the role of their leader, and put an end to this story!

Wait a minute... Putting an end to the story is true, but which leader to assume is up to the player. Besides the rebels, you can lead the orcs themselves and prove their strength, or side with the assassins, who are adept at siding with any government and always pursuing their own agenda. Yes, Gothic 3 offers three story campaigns, and thus three endings. The story will unfold nonlinearly, depending heavily on the player's actions.

